  "reviews": [
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJkagu5AXzQQ0Rm6td_CSdPCo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wQldXdFdYMDR0ZG1sblMwdE1VbFZyUWxvNFpHYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Lola is a true professional, she works like no other: attentive, a perfectionist, punctual, and provides exceptional service… and now with Aitana's arrival, they're the best team. The salon is beautiful, with easy parking, and it's convenient and welcoming. The manicure lasts up to a month without damage; they use products that don't harm the nail bed. 100% recommended.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Lola es una gran profesional, trabaja como ninguna: atenta, perfeccionista, puntual, trato excepcional…  y ahora con la llegada de Aitana son el mejor equipo. Local precioso, fácil aparcamiento, cercano y acogedor. El servicio de uñas dura hasta el mes siguiente sin dañarse, trabajan con productos que no dañan el lecho ungueal de las uñas.Recomendación 100%.",
        "languageCode": "es"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "Nazaret Sanchez Garcia",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108630890191276570267/reviews",
        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKOufej8Q-i0FEH2mHk-6VHUG_y7Ib6AYcb1Ioo-RCl0WPdQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
      },
      "publishTime": "2026-08-10T20:11:26.504097084Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wQldXdFdYMDR0ZG1sblMwdE1VbFZyUWxvNFpHYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wQldXdFdYMDR0ZG1sblMwdE1VbFZyUWxvNFpHYxAB!2m1!1s0xd41f305e42ea891:0x2a3c9d24fc5dab9b"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJkagu5AXzQQ0Rm6td_CSdPCo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prMlJEUnNiMGMxZUdJMFpGRXliM0JrVjI1NmNHYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I've been going to Loli for several years now. Since she taught me the importance of nail health, I haven't gone anywhere else! She's amazing, I recommend her 100%. I also want to mention Aitana for the excellent eyebrow lamination she did for me. Without a doubt, the best!",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Llevo varios años ya con Loli. Desde que me enseñó la importancia de la salud de las uñas no he vuelto a ir a otro sitio! Es una máquina, la recomiendo al 100%. También hacer mención a Aitana por el excelente laminado de cejas que me ha hecho. Sin duda, las mejores!!!!!!",
        "languageCode": "es"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "Marina Oliver",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110832186610420515910/reviews",
        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQ6hz-du5HWxM_xmeepsoWri61a9WAZ6TsYi3A7RFXAisk2h8v=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
      },
      "publishTime": "2026-09-04T15:56:08.067840354Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prMlJEUnNiMGMxZUdJMFpGRXliM0JrVjI1NmNHYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prMlJEUnNiMGMxZUdJMFpGRXliM0JrVjI1NmNHYxAB!2m1!1s0xd41f305e42ea891:0x2a3c9d24fc5dab9b"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJkagu5AXzQQ0Rm6td_CSdPCo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKWWREUkJablJIU2taSVZXVkZTbkpCU2xwTlJtYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "This is the first time I've had my nails done by Lola, and I couldn't be happier. I arrived with practically no nails because I bite them, and I left with completely different hands—super natural!\nI'm thrilled!",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Es la primera vez que me hago las uñas con Lola y no puedo estar más contenta, llegué casi sin uña porque me las muerdo y salí viéndome unas manos totalmente diferentes, súper naturales.\nEstoy encantadisima !",
        "languageCode": "es"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "Laura JM",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112112612034576889377/reviews",
